{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52560","headline":"真妄偈 · 复礼","name":"真妄偈","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"真法性本净，妄念何由起？从真有妄生，此妄何所止？无初即无末，有终应有始。\n无始而无终，长怀懵兹理。\n愿爲开玄妙，析之出生死。\n（《林间录》卷上）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"复礼","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52560.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52560","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}